        "nom": "Tamsyn Hailes, 05/16/2023",
        "texte": "Amazing! My dad struggled to get to an official photo booth for his ePhoto in France. We got his photo done at home using the app. It was a little dark, but they Photoshopped it so it was clear and precise, exactly like a passport photo. We received the ePhotos within 24 hours and a few days later received the actual ones in the post. I didn't need them, but just in case. This is the first time I've used an app that does exactly what it says with no problems! Well done, Smart photo!!!",
        "titre": "Efficient"
      },
      {
        "nom": "Bernard Mitchell, 05/14/2023",
        "texte": "It took a few attempts to get the photo approved, but it has tips on what to do differently. Both myself and my husband used this app to get new passports, and our photos were accepted first time by the passport office. Much cheaper than using a photo booth.",
